| `IMP-003` | If jobs no longer become terminal after five attempts, the existing `dead_letter` event may stop being emitted, causing alert consumers to lose notification of permanently unhealthy exports. | `verified` | `refining` | `INV-002` and `INV-003`; current event threshold and alert recovery semantics are not otherwise supplied. | `affects` `REQ-001`, `INV-002`, `INV-003`; `produces` `AC-003` |
